NOTICE — Scope of this license

This MIT license covers ONLY the companion code in this repository:
the `code/`, `appendix-c-template/`, `shiny_apps/`, and `quiz/`
folders (R scripts, Shiny apps, lockfiles, project-template files,
and the quiz-bank CSV/Markdown/app).

It does NOT cover:
- The book's prose, figures, and typeset content
  (`typst_project/`, `Chapter Markdowns/`), which remains
  All Rights Reserved pending a publishing decision by the author.
- Any data placed in `data/`, which carries its own licensing terms
  per `data/README.md` and the book's Appendix F data dictionary
  once published.

This split (permissive code license, reserved content rights) is
standard practice for technical books with companion repositories,
and is deliberately left open pending the author's choice of
publisher vs. self-publication route — do not assume a book-content
license has been decided; ask the author before stating one.
